```mermaid
flowchart TD
    %% NOTE: This diagram represents the PROPOSED FUTURE MICROSERVICES ARCHITECTURE
    %% The current production deployment uses a Modular Monolith on Google Cloud Run.

    subgraph Client ["Client Interface"]
        WebClient["🌐 Next.js / React Modern Frontend SPA"]
    end

    subgraph APIGateway ["API Management Layer"]
        Gateway["🛡️ Cloud API Gateway / Kong Ingress\n(Authentication, Rate Limiting, CORS)"]
    end

    subgraph Microservices ["Target Distributed Microservices"]
        DocService["📦 Document Ingestion Service\n(PDF Parsing, OCR, Tika, Chunking)"]
        EmbedService["🧠 Embedding Generation Microservice\n(FastAPI + Triton Inference Server / GPU)"]
        VectorDB[("⚡ Distributed Vector Database\n(Qdrant / Milvus / Pinecone Cluster)")]
        RAGRouter["🎯 Adaptive RAG Query Router\n(Escalation Logic, Query Decomposition)"]
        LLMOrchestrator["✨ LLM Generation & Guardrail Service\n(Gemini 2.5, LangGraph, Hallucination Checks)"]
    end

    subgraph StorageMessageBus ["Data & Event Infrastructure"]
        Kafka["📨 Event Bus / Cloud Pub/Sub\n(Async Document Processing Queue)"]
        CloudStorage[("🪣 Cloud Object Storage (GCS Bucket)")]
        MetadataDB[("🗄️ PostgreSQL / Cloud SQL\n(User, Workspace & Chunk Metadata)")]
    end

    WebClient -->|REST / WebSocket| Gateway
    Gateway -->|Ingest Request| DocService
    Gateway -->|User Query| RAGRouter

    DocService -->|Store PDF| CloudStorage
    DocService -->|Publish 'doc_uploaded'| Kafka
    Kafka -->|Async Consume| EmbedService
    EmbedService -->|Store Vectors| VectorDB
    DocService -->|Save Metadata| MetadataDB

    RAGRouter -->|Vector Search| VectorDB
    RAGRouter -->|Context & Prompt| LLMOrchestrator
    LLMOrchestrator -->|Grounded Response| RAGRouter
    RAGRouter -->|Final Response + Citations| Gateway
```
